  * Every state renders (loading/content/empty/error + live/stale/offline) — never a blank box.
  * i18n keys from source reproduced verbatim: common.clear, search.history.title,
    search.history.removeAria, search.history.clear (+ searchInput.* native enrichments).
  * Telemetry view.opened with surface slug "SearchInput" (P1/S11); VoiceOver labels on every
